      <activity id="3f18c558-8c5f-5ce9-98e5-bee22c161f01" activityNameId="f100eea8-b2cc-546c-86dc-3cc411c18404" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal, at regional storage
Average transport distance specific for the country has been used. Dust from transport and load/unload operations is included. Average coal losses are considered. Average emissions to water due to leaching from coal heaps at storage is estimated from the literature.;
UUID: e711bb5c-450b-394f-89fc-889ab3d075c6
This module includes an average transport of the coal to border of producing country and storage.
Location: Generic values applicable worldwide.
Technology: Not specified
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e711bb5c-450b-394f-89fc-889ab3d075c6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
